<title>UK: OPEC basket price slips six cts to $16.84 on Friday.</title>
<headline>OPEC basket price slips six cts to $16.84 on Friday.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The price of OPEC's basket of seven crudes stood at $16.84 a barrel on Friday, down from $16.90 on Thursday, the OPEC news agency said, quoting the OPEC Secretariat.</p>
<p>The basket comprises Algeria's Saharan Blend, Indonesia's Minas, Nigeria's Bonny Light, Saudi Arabia's Arabian Light, Dubai of the UAE, Venezuela's Tia Juana and Mexico's Isthmus.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7630</p>
